flowchart TD
    user([User])
    cli[CLI Interface]
    language[Language Detection]
    intent[Intent Classifier]
    router[Smart Router]
    manager[Service Manager]
    formatter[Response Formatter]
    tts[Piper TTS]

    ollama[(Ollama Local LLM)]
    groq[(Groq API)]
    hf[(Hugging Face API)]
    wiki[(Wikipedia API)]
    weather[(Open-Meteo API)]
    maps[(OpenStreetMap API)]

    user -->|User input| cli
    cli -->|Raw text| language
    language -->|Language + text| intent
    intent -->|Intent + confidence| router
    router -->|Provider request| manager

    manager --> ollama
    manager --> groq
    manager --> hf
    manager --> wiki
    manager --> weather
    manager --> maps

    ollama --> manager
    groq --> manager
    hf --> manager
    wiki --> manager
    weather --> manager
    maps --> manager

    manager -->|Structured response| formatter
    formatter -->|Display metadata + assistant message| cli
    formatter -->|Assistant message only| tts
    cli -->|Display output| user
    tts -->|Speech output| user
